# Keep the original 1.12.2 reference jar + compat helper jar OUT of source control
# (re-download via gradle / mod page if needed)
# Uncomment if you want to track them:
# CubicChunks-1.12.2-*-all.jar
# [CC]CubicChunksCompatibilityHelper-*.jar

# Immersive Portals jars — they aren't project source. `ip_source/` is
# shipped alongside as a reference copy of Qouteall's MIT source tree; the
# CubicChunks build does NOT compile or link against it (IP integration
# is via `cubicchunks.immersiveportals.mixins.json` at runtime). The ~5 MB
# of released jars across both upstream naming families (hyphen + underscore)
# are pulled from Modrinth / the IP releases page. Anchored to `.jar`, so
# the pattern cannot collide with the `.java` files under `ip_source/` or
# any of the `.json` mixin configs.
**/immersive[-_]portals*.jar
